			"Message": "style(Output): Normalize esbuild output with imports-first ordering and tab indentation\n\nRe-align all compiled artifacts under Configuration/ to a consistent esbuild output format with three structural changes:\n\n1. Hoist static `import` statements above the `__defProp`/`__name` helper shim declarations so every module reads as imports-first, helpers-second, code-third — matching the ideal ESM preamble order.\n\n2. Convert indentation back to tabs from the 2-space style applied in the previous normalize pass; tabs produce narrower diffs against upstream VS Code sources and match the Rust-side fmt convention adopted across the Land project.\n\n3. Normalise array literal formatting, trailing commas, and export blocks — multi-entry arrays get one entry per line with consistent trailing punctuation, and `export { ... }` blocks collapse to single-line when space permits.\n\nAffects all 100+ files across Apply, ESBuild, Plugin, Polyfill, Service, and Transform configuration directories. No runtime behaviour changes.",
			"SHA": "88983f834cd9a4d9dc192f5e596c70ad9a17f2ff"
		},
